WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.240
Adoption depends on funded foundations.

00:00:02.460 --> 00:00:06.440
The stack includes people and business
ownership, runnable engineering,

00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:10.280
and supported services.
Infrastructure, pipelines,

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:14.720
test data, service virtualization
and observability need accountable owners.

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:17.440
Our Banking Client has not been assessed,

00:00:17.493 --> 00:00:21.760
so the dependency backlog can still
change scope, cost and timing.

00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:25.520
The setup allowance is a planning
input, not a client quote.

00:00:25.607 --> 00:00:29.360
Leadership should approve the enabling
work together with the AI use case.
